# (build 163) The party's default names follow the language: chosen, then
# set back before the fight. Rolf's name was his default (Eusis) and is
# the cartridge's again (ROLF): a name that is any language's default is
# the chosen one's (gamedata_language_names), so the stock text names him
# as the stock game does -- and every route's save, all in the cartridge's
# language, keeps its names.
start battle 1
language retranslation
wait idle
language us
wait ticks 1
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
expect script $1211
expect text "ROLF and party"
